DEFINE POPUP shortcut SHORTCUT RELATIVE FROM MROW(),MCOL()
DEFINE BAR 1 OF shortcut PROMPT "> RSR Original Format"
DEFINE BAR 2 OF shortcut PROMPT "> RSR with Amount and Discount"
ON SELECTION BAR 1 OF shortcut mpntopt = 1
ON SELECTION BAR 2 OF shortcut mpntopt = 2

ACTIVATE POPUP shortcut